{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "10d7346fdd3449db197379077de7cc7fb3c9abbb4dcca69802105c735b8f951c", "ja": "（今日は、次の定期公演のミーティングだ。\nのり子はもう、来ているかな……？）", "zh": "（今天要开下一场定期公演的会议。不知道纪子已经来了吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "15ba591117ba45e2ff6f745de3476bb95dba39c755de36fb4aec68ff8b7cbab5", "ja": "天海さん。『THE☆アイドルショー』の\nクイズコーナーは、早押しでしたよね。", "zh": "天海小姐。《THE☆偶像秀》的\n问答环节，是抢答形式对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "33f0c2025b5df8034577d3628aed83150a3d3aebd77e09f64d4967b03e576239", "ja": "どういった問題が多いなど、傾向はありますか？", "zh": "这类题目的出题倾向，有什么规律吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "50e5e7b38d7716337f91410a8aa0129f9f241f628f254210324dcc3b41ca926e", "ja": "早押しクイズだけど、内容までは……ううん。\nけっこう、いろんな問題が出たと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "虽然是抢答题，不过具体内容就……嗯。\n我记得题目种类挺多的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "3069b2aa0f834db79b95d6056bc5a9313ac0903df770723828a12d3df9cc5434", "ja": "なんだか手強そうだね！　これは本当に\n特訓していかないと、厳しいかも……？", "zh": "感觉好像挺棘手的呢！这下要是不好好特训一番，可能真的会很难应付……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "ad01e6ef077457c19ebc29087a6058e7b4adf0f3d8526d606f2d36eff5dc15e7", "ja": "でも、クイズって緊張するんだよね。特に、時間制限が\nあると頭の中が真っ白になっちゃって……ううっ。", "zh": "不过，答题真的会让人紧张呢。尤其是有时间限制的时候，脑子里就会一片空白……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "ea787759c6cc1d34e26fb03d35340703e7d01f691b5dcb47919b8a267b3028ba", "ja": "わかる！　わかるよ、春香！", "zh": "我懂！我懂你的感受，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "c36ae8bd3bb8bb6ee8a7a3fac2f15f4a09af55866d3388cf37a0be144eb09572", "ja": "ですが、それも早押しクイズの醍醐味です。\n手に汗握る緊張感……ワクワクしてきたぞ。", "zh": "不过，这也是抢答竞猜的乐趣所在。\n这种让人捏一把汗的紧张感……我开始兴奋起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "ed1f87f024ca6a7f9c94dc1ad9faad6b4c190eccd350f202caa476ca6a8c0826", "ja": "瑞希……真剣だね？", "zh": "瑞希……你很认真嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "1f17ad09366b035016974f71d1649de80e9042fff07f772e64421d7c7207d408", "ja": "はい。765プロのクイズ女王（自称）として、\n負けるわけにはいきません。", "zh": "是的。作为765职业的问答女王（自称），我可不能输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "b8476698c441af51f5ccadbe6ad17061e3329f11f0ad7fea33ff37673ec4fb00", "ja": "瑞希……\nアタシ達、劇場の仲間だよね？", "zh": "瑞希……\n我们是剧场的伙伴，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "df965a2499e96b3ceb2a1a2e1004033a182e45deb96a1be0c8d544c9bb9203cc", "ja": "はい。ですが、同じ劇場の仲間だからこそ。\n得意分野では負けられないのです。", "zh": "是的。正因为是同一个剧场的伙伴，\n所以在各自擅长的领域不能输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "cfb772be59ace347af9d631413a087ff798264d454e764add8e0b3c0dfdcf861", "ja": "得意分野では負けられない、か……。うん。\nわかったよ、瑞希ちゃん。お互いがんばろうね！", "zh": "在擅长的领域绝不能输，吗……嗯。\n我明白了，瑞希。我们彼此都加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "d3169012c3d0fcf1b83ec9e3665351826ea888b375bd1148f83de7912e8d1b0d", "ja": "ええっ！\nも、もしかして春香、瑞希の味方なの！？", "zh": "诶诶！\n难、难道说春香，你是站在瑞希那边的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "25a7217c6331175cc5793365c820e4c07852323f1af5a6e9b14c49124a5a01de", "ja": "えっと、味方とか、そういうわけじゃないんだけど。\n仲間だから、真剣にやらなくちゃっていうか……。", "zh": "那个，我也不是说要站在她那边。\n只是因为是同伴，所以得认真对待才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "1e4d8b2458753ae50fe885dad4bd1d27b38663e6b62d46bf21f58c97a00baabf", "ja": "お疲れさまです～……あら、みんな早いのね。\n{$P$}さんは……。", "zh": "辛苦了～……哎呀，大家来得真早啊。\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "7d62c387535e74e422c6a431f12a4a66fb54d8a73bad56448b3b3da08468a719", "ja": "肝心の{$P$}くんが来てないの？", "zh": "关键的{$P$}先生还没来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "eb8094e71cc23310718993562f0243deebd73d64771b4c0ddb2b34ed68230ba4", "ja": "お疲れさまです、三浦さん、百瀬さん。\nもうすぐ集合時間なので、そろそろかと。", "zh": "辛苦了，三浦小姐、百濑小姐。集合时间快到了，我想他也差不多该来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "5366018381051a2429f654208087a7d8a7269f01a3654f5a0efe26aadde62704", "ja": "なら{$P$}さんが来るまで、\nみんなでおしゃべりでもしてましょうか。", "zh": "那在{$P$}先生到来之前，大家一起聊聊天吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "b659b9811907d4219cb6772c21f68761a763bc94efe565940f79da88d966afb2", "ja": "そうね！　ところで……3人で盛り上がってたみたい\nだけど、何の話？　お姉さん達も、混ぜて混ぜて～♪", "zh": "是啊！不过话说回来……你们好像和3个人聊得正热闹，这是在聊什么呀？也让姐姐们加入吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "fd9d990543cf3e01c5061e5dd0db726d9a2b559bdc342908ecab0a758090ea93", "ja": "莉緒姉～！　あずささんも、聞いてくれる？\n春香と瑞希がね～……。", "zh": "莉緒姐——！小梓，你也听一听好吗？春香和瑞希她们啊——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "8703df8b393529b7cd0a5b0e335a850c6768f4a552cee85a33cb206b90a90142", "ja": "なるほど～、今度の『THE☆アイドルショー』ね！\n私も何か対策を考えておかないとかしら……。", "zh": "原来是这样～，是下次的《THE☆偶像秀》啊！\n我是不是也得考虑点对策才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "a8b05b81255a8137866a363a758285807e182c1d194484cc7aa7c1fddb4e242e", "ja": "私も、クイズの早押し問題は苦手で……。\n答えがわかった時には、他の人が押してしまってて。", "zh": "我也不擅长抢答题……\n等我知道答案的时候，已经被别人抢先按下按钮了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1025_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1026_p", "source_sha256": "745ebd049da104a210ff1851ddc947f7c504c01047081bd8991cb28db8a75b92", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ！　……うん、全員揃ってるな。\n早速、ミーティングを始めるぞ。", "zh": "大家久等了！……嗯，所有人都到齐了。\n马上开始开会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "bd8900cf1767966c4d5fcc8efdf14365fc32c697b01356e6e0f2f3a709c0cd51", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！　今日の話って\nもしかして、『THE☆アイドルショー』のこと？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！今天要说的事，\n难道是《THE☆偶像秀》的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3688dffa8a645b5ca55e994cb7b7b50c9a1c50843badc4f77b4690f4d5b10582", "ja": "その事もだけど、メインは次の定期公演についてだ。\n実はここにいる5人に、出演してもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "那件事也是，不过主要是想谈谈下一次定期公演。  \n其实，我想请在场的5个人出演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "0cc8b9bca0cf3efdae2ab62e0404a70058580bfc99d47c6fc8a18ead275f066e", "ja": "まぁ……テレビに出演する5人で、\n定期公演ですか？", "zh": "哎呀……由出演电视的5个人，\n来举办定期公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "edb2191edf4a30be4292ebcb4ad19742b06ebba7cca51e6b88cdf40936dbb354", "ja": "それいいわね、{$P$}くん！\n劇場の宣伝になるじゃない♪", "zh": "这主意不错呀，{$P$}！还可以给剧场宣传呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1031_p", "source_sha256": "c97ad35512041d4662675331135596963e2548742f1bfcd5bdf0b4dd2319432b", "ja": "そういう事だから、みんな存分に活躍してきてくれ！\nそれと、のり子には新曲を歌ってもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "就是这么回事，所以大家尽情大显身手吧！\n另外，我打算让野典子唱一首新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "d75060b80127bec12302b90d16bbe9b8595dcb5bb6baef13a2e1f185ccf1b833", "ja": "えっ？　……あ、アタシが新曲歌うの！？", "zh": "咦？……啊，我要唱新歌！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "e1139770209c524ebb4abd338862148bccffb3ad70aef953506ac83945aa73c6", "ja": "福田さん、おめでとうございます。\nどんな曲か、楽しみですね。……ワクワク。", "zh": "福田小姐，恭喜你。\n真期待是什么样的曲子呢。……好兴奋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1034_p", "source_sha256": "fcba1c0619f817bcd6f3a7f944cc1d3f990e884660bb5e4edf4689a8da5db956", "ja": "ああ。ちょうど、曲のデモが届いたところなんだ。\nのり子、聞いてみるか？", "zh": "啊，歌曲小样刚好送到了。\n小纪，要听听看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "e2428d7c47e0d94d2398858f7977774924b934a5a672e6a600607e2760682600", "ja": "う、うん！　お願い、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！拜托了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "c06175e54a94b07baaa9b306cada11fc0308dc3fb24352f40044af2a76f7a467", "ja": "わ！　こ、これが、アタシの曲……！？", "zh": "哇！这、这就是我的歌……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1038_046rio", "source_sha256": "f12493b88d35cf4b00c240162d9dd69773fae65f54c98a8bdd430bdb48e13745", "ja": "あら、素敵♪\n明るくて、楽しそうな曲じゃない。", "zh": "哎呀，真棒♪\n这不是首欢快又开心的曲子嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "9642c910a7620e01b32e7e2e82a5540af26c795073ad759dbea68a127bd71ee9", "ja": "そうですね！　のり子ちゃんにピッタリ……\nあれ？　のり子ちゃん、どうかしたの？", "zh": "是啊！非常适合纪子……\n咦？纪子，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "6717b7ee44ff85d56e9c7237463148bf93f07b67e9a4bb489454a7d820d765ab", "ja": "あ、ううん！　なんか、\n可愛い曲だからビックリしちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，不，没什么！只是因为是首可爱的歌，一下子有点惊讶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "ce99c56542e55e1fd9546abc7fed2acd7cc7bc3ce2e98b90ac59a8b3b6f186a0", "ja": "でも、そっか。アタシにピッタリなら良かった……\nなんか、照れちゃうね？　へへ。", "zh": "不过，这么说来，只要适合我就好……\n总觉得有点害羞呢？嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1042_p", "source_sha256": "c259daf4fe68302de67d3cebe899200265be5c69b3694feda7ae1736d99099ff", "ja": "のり子。せっかくだから、次の公演に向けて、\n何か目標を立てみたらどうだ？", "zh": "典子。难得有这个机会，不如为下一场公演定个目标，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1043_043nor", "source_sha256": "c42afb0b94b1eb3560853d4eec077039e14042362f81e313ccbc9f27c64d22bd", "ja": "へっ？　目標？", "zh": "诶？目标？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1044_p", "source_sha256": "b9aacc5b93a1f4b04d90adc09e60cd6394dcbb0134ea04cdbcaffb2a49173510", "ja": "ああ。壮大な目標じゃなくていいんだけど……\nのり子なりの目標を設定して、新曲に挑んでみないか。", "zh": "嗯。不用设定什么宏大的目标……不如设定一个属于你的目标，挑战一下新歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1045_p", "source_sha256": "9ccf5db10873fb934f8fc77cb5e3f97bd32b131b3423c6db2fa3ecd7ff97f8ec", "ja": "そのほうが、のり子にとってもいいんじゃないかと\n思ったんだけど。どうだ？", "zh": "我觉得这样对你来说也更好。你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "71f9fab80acd6687df92de6eebcdffb820f279d5b66348f7682d4ba220f32d01", "ja": "うん……わかったよ、{$P$}。\nアタシ、やってみる！", "zh": "嗯……我明白了，{$P$}。\n我会试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_073_1047_043nor", "source_sha256": "a376e2a7f7e801be1a1771017eb17d8ef649b79e6f35d086b2377d560dff2747", "ja": "けど、目標か……目標……。\nアタシなりの……うーん。", "zh": "不过，目标吗……目标……。\n属于我自己的……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
